GLORYS12V1 product at `/orcd/compute/gforget/001/GLORYS/`:
Monthly fields from 2023 to 2026 Aug:
3d: 
  temperature
  salinity
  horizontal velocity (u, v)
2d:
  SSH,
  MLD
, as well as other fields not used in this Hackathon.

The script used to download the GLORYS data is `../scripts/download_global_phy_monthly_allvars.py`
